      "statement": "The langgraph-sdk provides async-first client implementations (get_client() and get_sync_client()) that connect to a LangGraph API server running at a configurable URL (default http://localhost:8123) and auto-load API keys from environment variables (LANGGRAPH_API_KEY, LANGSMITH_API_KEY, or LANGCHAIN_API_KEY) in priority order.",
