      "id": "claim_d10bce18fb37477ca65ddafbcb0f5694",
      "statement": "The v2 streaming protocol (client.runs.stream()) streams individual events via SSE with StreamPart objects (event type and data dict); the v3 protocol (client.threads.stream()) provides a shared SSE connection to one thread with typed projections (values, messages, tool_calls, custom extensions) and synchronized command dispatch (run.start, run.respond).",
