      "id": "claim_6c2d18fae6904de380f41b83d6a50e46",
      "statement": "AsyncThreadStream is an async context manager that owns a single SSE connection per thread session, routes events to multiple concurrent subscribers via a fan-out dispatcher (asyncio.Queue-based), manages a lifecycle watcher for terminal state (completed/failed), and exposes typed projections (values, messages, tool_calls, extensions) that are single-consumer streams.",
