      "id": "claim_7612160979934f60be3cfd1b53861d07",
      "statement": "The RunModule (thread.run) dispatches commands to the server via _send_command: run.start() sends the initial input/config/metadata, waits for the lifecycle to signal run readiness, and returns the run_id; run.respond() resumes interrupted runs by sending the human response to a matching interrupt_id.",
